{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FlavorDressing.PairProductCoefficientBound","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FlavorDressing.PairProductCoefficientBound","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.List","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Group.List","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FlavorDressing.pairSum_lt_half_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FlavorDressing.pairSum_lt_half_sq","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FlavorDressing/PairProductCoefficientBound.lean#L56-L74","doc":"**The ½ ceiling.** For a nonempty list of positive reals, the pairwise-product sum is strictly\nless than half the square of the total: `2·pairSum s < (Σ s)²`. Equivalently the second-order\ncoefficient of any positive-weight multiplicative pair product satisfies\n`α = pairSum s / (Σ s)² < 1/2`. Consequence: the measured flavor-split `α ≈ 0.929254 > 1/2` cannot\narise from such a product — the positive-weight pair-count mechanism is excluded (scope-(b)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FlavorDressing.sq_sum_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FlavorDressing.sq_sum_eq","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FlavorDressing/PairProductCoefficientBound.lean#L45-L54","doc":"The Newton identity `(Σ s)² = Σ s² + 2·(Σ_{i<j} s_i s_j)` (sorry-free, induction on the list). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FlavorDressing.pairSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FlavorDressing.pairSum","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FlavorDressing/PairProductCoefficientBound.lean#L39-L43","doc":"Sum of pairwise products `Σ_{i<j} s_i s_j` over a list: each element times the sum of the\nelements strictly after it. ","signatureChunk":0}]}